ng footprint.\nJ5 NTC contact is NC on this board. Unplug pack for charging in a compatible protected external setup." (at 12 192.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "01d033ea-a226-5412-93a0-1b504e76fc8d")))
